aligned}{S}_{xx}=663,\\,{S}_{yy}=1\\,092,\\,{S}_{xy}=975.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, $Cov(x,y)=$\n{{field-1}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540110 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f9b76f6d-a314-5376-893f-3c9706a4c31e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540110 #edb/ref 1074 "Given a set of $n$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n},$ their covariance can be calculated as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Cov(x,y) & =\\frac{{S}_{xy}}{n},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${S}_{xy}$ is the sum of products of the deviations of ${x}_{i}$ and ${y}_{i}$ from their means.\n\nWe are given that ${S}_{xy}=975.$ Substituting the given statistic in the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Cov(x,y) & =\\frac{975}{39} \\\\  & =25.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540115 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186539965 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540115 #edb/ref 1069 "q-251794" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540115 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540115 #edb/ref 1071 "Consider two sets of $14$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{14},$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{14}.$ You are given that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\sum }_{i=1}^{14}{x}_{i}=157, \\\\  & {\\sum }_{i=1}^{14}{y}_{i}=182, \\\\  & {\\sum }_{i=1}^{14}{x}_{i}{y}_{i}=2\\,227.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, ${S}_{xy}=$\n{{field-1}}." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540115 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "fe1475b2-e88a-5639-9c34-aefc361e0ff5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540115 #edb/ref 1074 "Given a set of $n$ paired observations ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}$ and ${y}_{1},{y}_{2},…,{y}_{n},$ the statistic ${S}_{xy}$ be calculated as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{S}_{xy} & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}({x}_{i}-\\overset{―}{x})({y}_{i}-\\overset{―}{y}) \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i}{y}_{i}-\\frac{1}{n}({\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{x}_{i})({\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{y}_{i}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given statistics in the above formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{S}_{xy} & =2\\,227-\\frac{1}{14}(157)(182) \\\\  & =2\\,227-2\\,041 \\\\  & =186.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540117 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186540176 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540117 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "075080f4-fbd5-5910-aa84-ddaafacb2543" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540117 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186540115 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540130 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3b3dc73d-4deb-517f-8239-1e28183ba06b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540130 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186540059 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540151 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186540117 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540151 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "7665738a-290c-5834-a4b9-da964e1eeec9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540151 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186204445 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540156 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186540130 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540156 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "8eb70679-39ee-53ce-aad6-c400551eb4cd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540156 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186540110 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540176 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186540156 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540176 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e5aeca2e-7232-51d5-aca3-7df63cf2122f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186540176 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186536838 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
